  "story": "On Will, the sun only rises if enough people want it to, so every morning the whole planet gets up early and wants it. Teenagers are a national problem. School mornings are always a bit late. After New Year's Eve, the whole planet slept in, and the sky stayed dark. Then, at five, the sun rose anyway. One spaniel had wanted it very much.",
